# What the image builder is sent: only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else (docs, tests, your .env and
# config.toml, the catalog and photos folders, anything of your own next to compose.yaml) stays on this machine.
# The whisper image has its own: whisper_service/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
